{
  "text": [
    "As mentioned in the introduction, hospital episode data may be sufficient for acute hospital care requiring events.",
    "However, for chronic conditions, as illustrated here with CKD, the use  of corroborating additional data when admissions are due to another event or comorbidity may be necessary."
  ],
